        "night Crepus died",
        "Crepus's death"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Crepus: The night of Diluc's eighteenth birthday",
      "content": "After Diluc's coming-of-age party at Angel's Share, Crepus and Diluc rode home with the winery's convoy. A monster attacked; even Diluc, with his Vision, could not hurt it. Crepus used a Delusion to destroy the drake and was mortally wounded by its backlash.",
